{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\": \"snapshot_suffix_monotonic_fix.json\", \"summary\": \"Resuming the one registered necessary gap: does the catch-up stall persist for a MonotonicLogStore, where installSnapshot already deletes the above-snapshot bytes via removeOldLogs? The previous attempt exited 1 not on a target assertion but in the upstream test helper's own 5s shutdown timer (`cluster.Close()`, testing.go:307) after the snapshot-resend storm slowed teardown.\\n\\nFix (harness only, previous_id set with revision reason): `MakeClusterOpts.LongstopTimeout` raised from the helper default 5s to 60s, and each scenario now prints its `scenario_setup`/`snapshot_catchup_result` CA_EVENT pair inside the scenario function, before the deferred `cluster.Close()` runs, so a slow teardown cannot hide a completed measurement. Scenarios, prefix, requirement, anchors and comparisons are unchanged (control; non-monotonic stall; monotonic stall), with applicability `stale_suffix`/`store_monotonic` selecting the case and the assertion `stalled == false`.\\n\\nLocal native feedback (not the formal receipt): all three scenarios now emit and the run exits 0 — control holds (applied 55 = leader commit 55), non-monotonic stalls (applied 45, leader commit 55, stalled=true), and the monotonic case stalls identically (snapshot_index=45, old_last_before=223, old_last_after=223, applied 45, stalled=true) even though `removeOldLogs` emptied the store. That is the discriminator: the cause is the cached `lastLogIndex/lastLogTerm` that `installSnapshot` never resets (no `setLastLog`), read by `getLastEntry` (state.go:167-174) and rejected at the `PrevLogEntry` check (raft.go:1475-1502) — not the retained log bytes.\\n\\nEnvelope validates (`valid: true`). If the retained execution completes with exit 0, the monotonic gap can be answered and the predecessor's `unresolved` interpretation superseded; the primary defect conclusion from receipt 2322bd7884b749f89c3101f04bc82e78 is unchanged. Draft file: `draft/snapshot_suffix_monotonic_fix.json` (harness: `draft/snapshot_suffix_harness_monotonic.go`).\"}"}}
